      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this is running on the AP, are we not able to query for the TPM DID:VID ?  If using USB, we can use the USB VID:PID.\n\nExcept that old/current OpenTitan chips report Dauntless identifiers, is that why we have the version logic below?  If so, I suppose we could retire the version logic, once we no longer need to support the factory GSC images on Z1 silicon.\n\nIn any case, I do not see why we would add a new TPMV command just to be able to distinguish GSC type?",
      "revId": "9088acacef26b7d6e2fdbe62f617485e20528861",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
